From c1dbaa5dc5d3901e4c95c2212c1584c9d9be6ccd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cjybyjk <cjybyjk@zjnu.edu.cn>
Date: Fri, 29 Jul 2022 09:12:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] PixelOS: Add status bar lyric

Port of Evolution-X commit b53bc2c6acc0 '[SQUASHED] base: Add status bar
lyric for Android 17' (branch cnb) to PixelOS.

Adaptations for PixelOS:
- HomeStatusBarViewBinder: no batteryBar/leftLogo/centered_area, and
  HomeStatusBarViewModel has no hideStartSideContentForHeadsUp flow, so
  the HUN hide condition is dropped (always false).
- evolution_dimens.xml / evolution_styles.xml replaced by new
  lyric_dimens.xml / lyric_styles.xml (evox-only files don't exist here).
- Settings key uses @Readable annotation (included in squash).

Based on Project Kaleidoscope status bar lyric, exTHmUI, Flyme behavior.
Original authors: KujouYuko, joeyhuab, LynnrinChan, AmeChanRain, Nift4,
NurKeinNeid, Arman-ATI and others.

Change-Id: Ifecbe5c3ec18a2d98074eb75a0e55fccad794937
